# Whiskervale Forerunner's valiant (CR 603.2): Bot1's Healing Salve targets the Forerunner on Bot1's own turn, so it looks at the top
# five cards (Island, Hill Giant, Ornithopter, Plains, Memnite - the fifth card counts, the Forest sixth does not), reveals the Memnite
# (a creature card of mana value 0) and puts it onto the battlefield untapped because it is Bot1's turn. Hill Giant (mana value 4)
# cannot be chosen, and only one card may be: the other four go to the bottom, leaving the Forest on top.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Gleemox
Whiskervale Forerunner
Healing Salve
Plains
Plains
Island
Hill Giant
Ornithopter
Plains
Memnite
Forest
Plains x8

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Gleemox.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Whiskervale Forerunner.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Gleemox.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Healing Salve.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Prevent the next 3 damage)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Whiskervale Forerunner)
? Stack.Count = 2
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Choose(Hill Giant)
! Bot1.Choose(Memnite; Ornithopter)
Bot1.Choose(Memnite)
? Bot1.Revealed = Memnite
Bot1.Accept
? Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Pearl; Gleemox; Whiskervale Forerunner; Memnite
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 2
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Pearl; Gleemox; Whiskervale Forerunner; Memnite
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Tapped = false
Bot1.Hand.Count = 2
Bot1.Library.Count = 13
Bot1.Library.Top = Forest
Bot1.Graveyard = Healing Salve; Black Lotus
Stack.Count = 0
